# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Referrer-Policy is load-bearing here rather than decorative: Locus must not
# hand its own URL to a tile host or to a source link the user opens.
# Permissions-Policy proves the v0.1 claim that geolocation is not used -- the
# browser refuses the API even if some future dependency asks for it.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
